<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 10,500 MT were primarily the result of increases for China (5,000 MT, all destination changes), Haiti (2,000 MT), unknown destinations (1,500 MT), and Colombia (1,500 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 26,900 MT were mainly to China (19,500 MT), Mexico (5,700 MT), and Colombia (1,500 MT).</p>
</text>
